      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having some problems reproducing the issue. Here's what we did:\n1. Player A favorited Player X to list 3.\n2. Player B favorited Player X to list 3.\n3. Waited for some time.\n4. Player A&B confirmed that Player X was added to list 3.\n5. Player A removed Player X from list 3.\n6. Player B waited an hour, then checked list 3.\nThis test showed that Player X was not removed from Player B's third list. We also had our team audit the code that handles favorite removal. Unfortunately, we were unable to reproduce the issue.\nHowever we **are** seeing cases of friends falling off favorite lists. The issue is occurring, we just don't think this is the reason why.\nLet us know if you get any more info!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
