      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also having this issue and it's been a massive problem for me. I had my favorites filled to the brim 96/96 and now it's down to 83/96.  It causes huge problems for a heavily social person like myself.  I haven't seen any specific reasons that would point to why it happens, though it does appear that the more active accounts are more likely to be removed.  I haven't really noticed disappearances of friends who haven't logged in during that time, but I regularly see ones drop off who are on daily.\nShould also mention there's a second bug report for this same issue but newer- https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/social-favorites-remove-themselves that should probably be rolled into this one.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
