  "details": "Under Social, player's you have favorited are randomly being unfavorited. \nReason:\nPlayer B has Player X favorited under favorite list 2.\nPlayer C has Player X favorited under favorite list 3.\nPlayer D has Player X favorited under favorite list 2.\nIf player C removed Player x from favorite. Nothing happens to Player B and C.\nIf player B removes Player X from favorites. Then Player D and ANYONE else who's favorited player X, will them them removed from their favorite.\nTL:DR\nRemoving a player from favorite removes that player from favorite for EVERYONE who's favorited that player.",
